133
00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.393
- Laporkan opini publik kepada saya.
- Ya, tuan.

134
00:10:44.477 --> 00:10:46.520
Posting pembaruan langsung
dari tim negosiasi.

135
00:10:46.604 --> 00:10:47.438
Ya, tuan.

